{"path":"container/inplace_vector/max_size","title":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::max_size","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::inplace_vector&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>max_size","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/max_size","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> size_type max_size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Maximum number of elements, i.e. <code>N</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Because each <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> is a fixed-capacity container, the value returned by <code>max_size</code> equals <code>N</code> (which is also the value returned by <span class=\"t-lc\">capacity()</span>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;inplace_vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> p<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">long</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> q<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF-8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/uppercase\"><span class=\"kw1791\">std::<span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"p.max_size() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1798\">std::<span class=\"me2\">dec</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = 0x\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1799\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"q.max_size() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1798\">std::<span class=\"me2\">dec</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> q.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = 0x\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1799\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> q.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>p.max_size() = 10 = 0xA\nq.max_size() = 10 = 0xA</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/capacity\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>capacity</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements that can be held in currently allocated storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/inplace_vector","title":"std::inplace_vector"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::max_size","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Maximum number of elements, i.e. N."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Because each std::inplace_vector<T, N> is a fixed-capacity container, the value returned by max_size equals N (which is also the value returned by capacity())."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"size","note":"returns the number of elements"},{"label":"capacity","note":"returns the number of elements that can be held in currently allocated storage"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":152,"codeBlockCount":2}
